# runs-keep.config — tflw `M241` `E` (`D1325`): `C120` (`config:directive:runs`).
#
# `runs keep 3`: how many runs `tflw ui` lists before it forgets the oldest ended one. Its control is
# `runs-keep-zero.config`, this file with the count at 0, which is refused at that line.

runs keep 3

env local default
  api "http://localhost:9/v1"
